  "content": {
    "problemStatement": "You are given a sequence of integers A1,A2,…,ANA_1, A_2, \\ldots, A_NA1​,A2​,…,AN​. You should process QQQ queries. In each query:\n\n\nYou are given two integer parameters ididid and vvv.\nChange the value of AidA_{id}Aid​ to vvv.\nThen, consider all ways to partition the sequence A1,A2,…,ANA_1, A_2, \\ldots, A_NA1​,A2​,…,AN​ into multisets M1,M2,…,MKM_1, M_2, \\ldots, M_KM1​,M2​,…,MK​ (for an arbitrary K≥1K \\ge 1K≥1) such that:\n\nEach element of AAA is assigned to exactly one multiset.\nThe medians of all multisets are the same.\n\n\nFind the maximum possible value of KKK, i.e. the maximum number of multisets in such a partition.\nThe median of a multiset is defined as follows: Consider the multiset as a sequence sorted in non-decreasing order. If its size is odd, the median is the middle element. If it is even, there are two integers in the middle and the median is the smaller one (either one if they are equal).\n\nNote that a multiset may contain duplicate elements, so if xxx elements of AAA with identical values are assigned to the same multiset, that multiset will contain the same integer xxx times.",
    "constraints": [
      "1≤T≤1,0001 \\le T \\le 1,0001≤T≤1,000",
      "1≤N,Q≤1051 \\le N, Q \\le 10^51≤N,Q≤105",
      "1≤Ai≤1091 \\le A_i \\le 10^91≤Ai​≤109 for each valid iii",
      "1≤id≤N1 \\le id \\le N1≤id≤N",
      "1≤v≤1091 \\le v \\le 10^91≤v≤109",
      "the sum of NNN over all test cases does not exceed 10610^6106",
      "the sum of QQQ over all test cases does not exceed 10610^6106",
      "Subtasks**Subtask #1 (50 points):**",
      "N,Q≤1,000N, Q \\le 1,000N,Q≤1,000",
      "the sum of NNN over all test cases does not exceed 10,00010,00010,000",
      "the sum of QQQ over all test cases does not exceed 10,00010,00010,000"
    ],
    "inputFormat": "The first line of the input contains a single integer TTT denoting the number of test cases. The description of TTT test cases follows.\nThe first line of each test case contains two space-separated integers NNN and QQQ.\nThe second line contains NNN space-separated integers A1,A2,…,ANA_1, A_2, \\ldots, A_NA1​,A2​,…,AN​.\nEach of the next QQQ lines contains two space-separated integers ididid and vvv describing a query.",
    "outputFormat": "For each query, print a single line containing one integer ― the maximum number of multisets.",
